From db3ff90905b921cc829a5dbc88fda5b567d676b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 09:22:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Library images, week filter, and a pack link at the top of
 each study

- Study page: a 'Get the research pack' button under the title jumps to the form and opens it
- Library cards show the study's Executive Visual; where a study has none, the falcon mark. Territory and week sit above the title
- The importer makes a web-sized copy of each visual (sharp) so the library does not load full-size images; cards fall back to the full image, then the mark
- Week filter on the Library and the Weekly Scan list, kept alongside the territory and type filters, with a count of studies shown
- Sitemap is built on request so new studies and signals appear in it
---
